{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0293_1005_p", "source_sha256": "10919feb2401d61b96d14db6b35fef1523144b31494676f00e9b9e08e28bd902", "ja": "そうか。喜んでもらえて、よかったよ。\n少しだけ、恥ずかしがるかも知れないと思ってたから。", "zh": "这样啊。你能喜欢，我就放心了。\n我本来还想着，你可能会有点害羞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0293_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d181b8ea493f1df663c8cfa2e47ac878629cdb88b8dd0f55a8028e0ba26e9277", "ja": "え？　恥ずかしがる……ですか？", "zh": "诶？害羞……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0293_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7d55a04d98c2a3ba1aea01c431a8803f2f04cdf7a2c29b2f9b7c553aab1d5054", "ja": "ああ。そのパジャマは可愛らしいけど、\n大人の色気もあるだろ？", "zh": "啊。那件睡衣虽然很可爱，但也有种成熟的魅力，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0293_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d91acc37633af14bebfed09d1f6b1721153309688b2a85b03ad05961879c0a54", "ja": "大人の色気……？　えっ、このパジャマって、\nもしかして、セクシーなんでしょうか！？", "zh": "成熟女性的魅力……？　咦，这件睡衣，\n难道说，很性感吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
