{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0293_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4ef1f1a664560672d087dd52eb2d6ca5614d1e0f11c66aecfc2e159ea3eefb61", "ja": "そ、そう言われてみれば、\n肩が出てるし、胸元も……ううっ……。", "zh": "仔、仔细想想，好像确实露着肩膀，胸口也……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
