{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0293_1014_p", "source_sha256": "686c91d87bc167e77b28e8d5d2efc412638037e387e8fa4255b795b406dde150", "ja": "えっ？　いや……。\n別に、その必要はないんじゃないか？", "zh": "诶？不……没必要吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0293_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8772f02585344f38281d66ea91b46bf73604f6b75a419fae98142e74c270e52a", "ja": "えっ……\nでも、セクシーな衣装なのに……いいんですか？", "zh": "诶……\n可是，明明是性感风格的服装……这样真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0293_1016_p", "source_sha256": "14bd1ab26722dd429ba3e7b73a53e0faa70b591292e9db7d35455b29ee0fc714", "ja": "まあ正直、最初はセクシー路線だったけど……。\nそのパジャマを着た風花を見て、考えを変えたんだ。", "zh": "其实坦白说，最初确实是走性感路线的……\n不过看到穿上那套睡衣的风花后，我就改变想法了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
